OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after six-year-old
OL,4,Aboy dies in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old boy has died following a
OL,7,Fcar crash and a man has been arrested,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to reports of an
OL,11,Fincident involving a vehicle and a
OL,12,Fchild in Llanfairfechan, Conwy county,
OL,13,Fafter 17:00 BST on Thursday evening,
OL,14,Fwhere the child was pronounced dead at
OL,15,Fthe scene.
OL,17,FNorth Wales Police said the 39-year-old
OL,18,Fman who was arrested had been helping
OL,19,Fit with inquiries, while the boy's
OL,20,Ffamily was being supported by specially
OL,21,Ftrained family liaison officers.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
